---
// 睡眠排行榜与成就徽章
---
<div class="w-full min-h-[600px] flex flex-col items-center justify-start bg-base-100 pt-8 pb-24 px-4">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-center">Ranking & Achievements</h2>
  <div class="w-full max-w-md bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-4 mb-4">
    <span class="font-semibold">本周睡眠时长排行榜</span>
    <ol class="mt-2 space-y-2">
      <li class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>1. 小明</span><span class="badge badge-primary">8h 20m</span></li>
      <li class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>2. 小红</span><span class="badge badge-secondary">8h 10m</span></li>
      <li class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>3. 小刚</span><span class="badge">7h 55m</span></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <div class="w-full max-w-md bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-4">
    <span class="font-semibold">成就徽章</span>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-2">
      <span class="badge badge-accent">早睡达人</span>
      <span class="badge badge-accent">连续7天达标</span>
      <span class="badge badge-accent">健康作息</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
